{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は大阪初日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら大阪公演は玲香が欠席出られないって事が発表されましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/23/3517830/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポンコツだと思ってたけど\nたくさんのことを任せてた事に気づいたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいか～\n早く一緒にツアーしたいよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれたみなさん、ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田推しは中田のこと見つけられましたかねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏はカナリンGOしてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/23/3517830/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nライブ終了後は\n沈金に電話出演させてもらいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまにも急遽\n出演してもらっちゃったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/23/3517830/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アシスタントをやってくださった西 恵利香さん\nありがとうございました！\n今度、西さんと直接お話ししてみたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/23/3517830/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週はスタジオに行けるので楽しみ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/23/3517830/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15thアンダー曲\n『シークレットグラフィティー』のMVが\n公式YouTubeで公開されました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/23/3517830/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもフルサイズ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はチアやっちゃいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/23/3517830/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きつめの三つ編みとか\nかなり久々にやりました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若返った気分です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ観てない人は観てねー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/23/3517830/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}